  "imagery": "Painted 3D-style illustrations of a globe with gold coins establish the brand's visual world — tactile, slightly surreal, rendered with soft gradients and warm light. Photography is minimal; when used, it's high-key and lifestyle-casual. Country flags appear as circular thumbnails in a 5-column grid — the only \"icon\" system is national identity. No abstract graphics, no stock patterns. The globe and coins are the recurring mascot motif, signaling global reach through a single warm, optimistic object rather than a montage.",
